{\b\fs22\cf2 ESA-Lite End User License Agreement (EULA)}\par
{\b Version 2.0.0 | DTS - Digital Transformation Services}\par
\par

{\b 1. Definitions}\par
"Software" refers to ESA-Lite Agent. "User" refers to the individual or entity using the software.\par
\par

{\b 2. License Grant}\par
This Lite Edition is a free public version. DTS grants you a non-exclusive, royalty-free license to use the software without any fees or charges.\par
\par

{\b 3. Windows Integration}\par
The software interacts with Windows via:\par
\tab - System32: Installing fallback drivers (PKCS11 DLLs).\par
\tab - Registry: Enabling auto-run on startup (HKCU\\...\\Run).\par
\tab - AppData: Storing logs and configuration files.\par
\tab - Certificate Store: Publishing token certificate for browser recognition.\par
\par

{\b 4. User Responsibilities}\par
The user is solely responsible for:\par
\tab - Safeguarding the physical USB Token.\par
\tab - Maintaining the secrecy of the PIN code.\par
\tab   DTS never stores or transmits your PIN.\par
\tab - Ensuring system compatibility before use.\par
\par

{\b 5. Disclaimer}\par
The software is provided "As-Is" without warranty of any kind, express or implied.\par
\par

{\b 6. Privacy & Data Protection}\par
ESA-Lite processes all cryptographic operations locally on your machine.\par
No certificate data, private keys, or identity information is transmitted to DTS or any third-party servers.\par
Logs are stored locally for diagnostic purposes only.\par
\par

{\b 7. Legal Compliance}\par
ESA-Lite is designed and operated in full compliance with Egyptian Law No. 15 of 2004\par
regulating Electronic Signatures and the establishment of ITIDA,\par
as well as its executive regulations and subsequent amendments.\par
\par
